{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-md-render",
  "category": "helpers",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-md-render&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-md-render",
  "styles": "",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": "MD + HTML + is-*. Inline brand-mono sin fondo. Bloques theme completo. Fences iswc-*. Lazy ensure.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-md-render>",
            "  <script type=\"text/markdown\">",
            "# Kit MD: render e hydratación",
            "",
            "Títulos con **color de marca**. Inline mono, bloques con theme, fences iswc-* y HTML is-*.",
            "",
            "## 1. Código",
            "",
            "Inline sin fondo: `ensure`, `loader.has`, `brand-mono`. Chip {{tono}}.",
            "",
            "### JavaScript",
            "",
            "```js",
            "const L = globalThis.ISWebComponentsLoader;",
            "await L.loadCSSBase();",
            "await L.load(\"iswc-md-render\");",
            "const saludo = (nombre) => `Hola ${nombre}`;",
            "```",
            "",
            "### TypeScript",
            "",
            "```ts",
            "type SkillDoc = { label: string; url: string };",
            "export function collect(docs: SkillDoc[]): string[] {",
            "  return docs.map((d) => d.url).filter(Boolean);",
            "}",
            "```",
            "",
            "### HTML / CSS",
            "",
            "```html",
            "<iswc-button color=\"brand\" size=\"sm\">Acción</iswc-button>",
            "```",
            "",
            "```css",
            ":host {",
            "  --_brand: var(--iswc-color-brand, #339af0);",
            "  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--_brand) 72%, var(--iswc-text));",
            "}",
            "```",
            "",
            "## 2. Diagramas (fences iswc)",
            "",
            "### Flowchart",
            "",
            "```iswc-flowchart",
            "{",
            "  \"flowchart\": {",
            "    \"title\": \"Alta rápida\",",
            "    \"direction\": \"LR\",",
            "    \"nodes\": [",
            "      {",
            "        \"id\": \"a\",",
            "        \"label\": \"Inicio\",",
            "        \"shape\": \"stadium\"",
            "      },",
            "      {",
            "        \"id\": \"b\",",
            "        \"label\": \"Validar\"",
            "      },",
            "      {",
            "        \"id\": \"c\",",
            "        \"label\": \"¿Ok?\",",
            "        \"shape\": \"diamond\"",
            "      },",
            "      {",
            "        \"id\": \"d\",",
            "        \"label\": \"Fin\",",
            "        \"shape\": \"stadium\"",
            "      }",
            "    ],",
            "    \"edges\": [",
            "      {",
            "        \"from\": \"a\",",
            "        \"to\": \"b\"",
            "      },",
            "      {",
            "        \"from\": \"b\",",
            "        \"to\": \"c\"",
            "      },",
            "      {",
            "        \"from\": \"c\",",
            "        \"to\": \"d\",",
            "        \"label\": \"sí\"",
            "      }",
            "    ]",
            "  }",
            "}",
            "```",
            "",
            "### Sequence",
            "",
            "```iswc-sequence",
            "{",
            "  \"sequence\": {",
            "    \"title\": \"Auth\",",
            "    \"actors\": [",
            "      {",
            "        \"id\": \"U\",",
            "        \"label\": \"User\",",
            "        \"kind\": \"actor\"",
            "      },",
            "      {",
            "        \"id\": \"A\",",
            "        \"label\": \"API\",",
            "        \"kind\": \"participant\"",
            "      }",
            "    ],",
            "    \"messages\": [",
            "      {",
            "        \"from\": \"U\",",
            "        \"to\": \"A\",",
            "        \"label\": \"POST /auth\"",
            "      },",
            "      {",
            "        \"from\": \"A\",",
            "        \"to\": \"U\",",
            "        \"label\": \"JWT\",",
            "        \"kind\": \"return\"",
            "      }",
            "    ]",
            "  }",
            "}",
            "```",
            "",
            "### Mindmap",
            "",
            "```iswc-mindmap",
            "{",
            "  \"mindmap\": {",
            "    \"title\": \"MD kit\",",
            "    \"layout\": \"tree\",",
            "    \"nodes\": [",
            "      {",
            "        \"id\": \"root\",",
            "        \"label\": \"iswc-md-*\",",
            "        \"hue\": 210",
            "      },",
            "      {",
            "        \"id\": \"a\",",
            "        \"parent\": \"root\",",
            "        \"label\": \"render\",",
            "        \"hue\": 199",
            "      },",
            "      {",
            "        \"id\": \"b\",",
            "        \"parent\": \"root\",",
            "        \"label\": \"editor\",",
            "        \"hue\": 160",
            "      },",
            "      {",
            "        \"id\": \"c\",",
            "        \"parent\": \"root\",",
            "        \"label\": \"hydrate\",",
            "        \"hue\": 38",
            "      }",
            "    ]",
            "  }",
            "}",
            "```",
            "",
            "## 3. HTML del kit",
            "",
            "<iswc-button color=\"brand\" size=\"sm\">Guardar</iswc-button>",
            "<iswc-button color=\"neutral\" variant=\"soft\" size=\"sm\">Cancelar</iswc-button>",
            "",
            "<iswc-tag color=\"brand\" size=\"sm\">lazy</iswc-tag>",
            "<iswc-tag color=\"success\" size=\"sm\">hydrate</iswc-tag>",
            "",
            "## 4. Tabla + lista + cita",
            "",
            "| Contenido | Qué pasa |",
            "| --- | --- |",
            "| `x` inline | iswc-code brand-mono, sin fondo |",
            "| fence js/ts/html/css | iswc-code theme dark/light |",
            "| fence iswc-flowchart | iswc-flowchart readonly |",
            "| iswc-button HTML | ensure iswc-button |",
            "",
            "1. md-lite marca fences / inline",
            "2. `ensure` solo tags necesarios",
            "3. Upgrade a iswc-code / diagramas",
            "",
            "> Solo hechos verificables. El loader no duplica módulos.",
            "",
            "---",
            "",
            "Enlace: [skills CDN](https://github.com/Jeff-Aporta/is-webcomponents).",
            "  </script>",
            "</iswc-md-render>"
          ],
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "boolean",
              "prop": "attr:can-edit",
              "label": "can-edit"
            },
            {
              "control": "text",
              "prop": "attr:placeholder",
              "label": "placeholder"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "embeds",
      "title": "Embeds de la sesión",
      "lede": "Checklist: títulos brand, código, iswc, HTML kit, tabla GFM.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Feature",
            "Cómo"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "Títulos h1-h6",
              "color-mix desde --iswc-color-brand"
            ],
            [
              "Inline code",
              "iswc-code theme=brand-mono, sin bg"
            ],
            [
              "Fence lang",
              "iswc-code preset dark/light"
            ],
            [
              "Fence iswc-*",
              "diagrama color=viewer"
            ],
            [
              "HTML is-*",
              "ensure lazy + upgrade"
            ],
            [
              "Loader cache",
              "importOnce + Cache API + IDB CSS"
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "editable",
      "title": "Editable in-place",
      "lede": "Con <code class=\"code\">can-edit</code>: contenteditable. <code class=\"code\">iswc-change</code> al blur; <code class=\"code\">iswc-persist</code> con Ctrl/Cmd+S.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-md-render can-edit placeholder=\"Escribe…\">",
            "  <script type=\"text/markdown\">",
            "Hola {{nombre}}, gracias por confiar en {{empresa}}.",
            "  </script>",
            "</iswc-md-render>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lazy",
      "title": "Lazy load",
      "lede": "El render llama al loader solo si el contenido pide <code class=\"code\">iswc-code</code>, un diagrama o un <code class=\"code\">is-*</code> en HTML. Si el tag ya está, no vuelve a pedir red.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Contenido",
            "Qué carga"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "Solo párrafos",
              "nada extra"
            ],
            [
              "inline code",
              "iswc-code brand-mono sin fondo"
            ],
            [
              "fence js/ts/...",
              "iswc-code theme completo"
            ],
            [
              "iswc-flowchart fence",
              "iswc-flowchart"
            ],
            [
              "<iswc-button>…",
              "iswc-button"
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "vs-editor",
      "title": "Frente al editor",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Necesitas",
            "Usar"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "Solo pintar MD embebido",
              "<code>iswc-md-render</code>"
            ],
            [
              "Edición ligera sin tools",
              "<code>iswc-md-render can-edit</code>"
            ],
            [
              "Toolbar, diálogo, CRUD/API",
              "<code>iswc-md-editor</code>"
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "ficha": {
